@startuml
actor User
boundary "views/memos/index.html.erb" as View
control "MemosController" as Controller
entity "Memo Model" as Model
database "Database" as DB

User -> View: Click "Delete" on memo
View -> Controller: Send DELETE /memos/:id request
Controller -> Model: Find memo by ID
Model -> DB: Query memo by ID
DB --> Model: Return memo object
Model -> DB: Delete memo from database
DB --> Model: Return success/failure
Model --> Controller: Confirm delete
Controller -> View: Redirect to memos index page
View -> User: Display updated list of memos
@enduml
